      "title": {
        "en": "Okazje i święta"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "More occasions for a wish: *ślub* (a wedding), *egzamin* (an exam), *choroba* (an illness) and *wyjazd* (going away). The holidays are *święta*: *Wigilia* is Christmas Eve on 24 December with a big family supper, then *Boże Narodzenie*, *sylwester* on 31 December, *Nowy Rok*, and *Wielkanoc* in March or April. *Na święta* is for the holidays, usually Christmas: *jadę do domu na święta*."
      }
    }
  ],
